\par }{\i C\'a8n c\'f8 Lu\'cbt T\'e6 ch\'f8c Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 ng\'b5y 30 th\'b8ng 9 n\'a8m 1992;
\par C\'a8n c\'f8 Lu\'cbt \'a7\'c7u t\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t Nam ng\'b5y 08 th\'b8ng 11 n\'a8m 1996; Lu\'cbt Khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch \'ae\'c7u t\'ad trong n\'ad\'edc (s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i) s\'e8 03/1998/QH10 ng\'b5y 20 th\'b8ng 5 n\'a8m 1998;
\par C\'a8n c\'f8 Lu\'cbt Thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u ng\'b5y 26 th\'b8ng 12 n\'a8m 1991; Lu\'cbt S\'f6a \'ae\'e6i b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a Lu\'cbt Thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u ng\'b5y 5 th\'b8ng 7 n
\'a8m 1993; Lu\'cbt S\'f6a \'ae\'e6i b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a Lu\'cbt Thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u s\'e8 04/1998/QH10 ng\'b5y 20 th\'b8ng 5 n\'a8m 1998;
\par Theo \'ae\'d2 ngh\'de c\'f1a B\'e9 tr\'ad\'ebng B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh,
\par }\pard \qc\sb360\sa160\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\f16\fs32\expnd4\expndtw24 Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh:
\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\fs26\expnd4\expndtw24 \'a7i\'d2u 1.}{ Thu\'d5 su\'cat thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u \'ae\'ad\'eec quy \'ae\'denh nh\'ad sau:
\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {1. Thu\'d5 su\'cat \'ae\'e8i v\'edi h\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u g\'e5m thu\'d5 su\'cat th\'abng th\'ad\'eang, thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i v\'b5 thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'ae\'c6c bi\'d6t:

\par a) Thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'b8p d\'f4ng cho h\'b5ng ho\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'e3 xu\'cat x\'f8 t\'f5 n\'ad\'edc ho\'c6c kh\'e8i n\'ad\'edc c\'e3 tho\'b6 thu\'cbn v\'d2 \'ae\'e8i x\'f6 t\'e8i hu\'d6 qu\'e8c trong quan h\'d6 th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v
\'edi Vi\'d6t Nam.
\par Thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'ae\'ad\'eec quy \'ae\'denh trong Bi\'d3u thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u do B\'e9 tr\'ad\'ebng B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh ban h\'b5nh. B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh ch\'f1 tr\'d7 c\'efng v\'edi B\'e9 Th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v\'b5 c\'b8c B\'e9 c
\'e3 li\'aan quan c\'a8n c\'f8 v\'b5o ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch xu\'cat, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, s\'f9 bi\'d5n \'ae\'e9ng v\'d2 gi\'b8 c\'b6 th\'de tr\'ad\'eang trong t\'f5ng th\'eai gian \'ae\'d3 \'aei\'d2u ch\'d8nh c\'b8c m\'f8c thu\'d5 su\'cat trong Bi\'d3u thu\'d5 nh
\'cbp kh\'c8u ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi khung thu\'d5 su\'cat do U\'fb ban Th\'ad\'eang v\'f4 Qu\'e8c h\'e9i quy \'ae\'denh.
\par b) Thu\'d5 su\'cat th\'abng th\'ad\'eang \'b8p d\'f4ng cho h\'b5ng ho\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'e3 xu\'cat x\'f8 t\'f5 n\'ad\'edc kh\'abng c\'e3 tho\'b6 thu\'cbn v\'d2 \'ae\'e8i x\'f6 t\'e8i hu\'d6 qu\'e8c trong quan h\'d6 th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i v\'edi Vi\'d6
t Nam.
\par Thu\'d5 su\'cat th\'abng th\'ad\'eang \'ae\'ad\'eec \'b8p d\'f4ng th\'e8ng nh\'cat cao h\'acn 50% (n\'a8m m\'ad\'aci ph\'c7n tr\'a8m) so v\'edi thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'aei\'d3m a, m\'f4c 1 c\'f1a \'a7i\'d2u n\'b5y. \'a7\'e8
i v\'edi nh\'f7ng tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep \'ae\'c6c bi\'d6t c\'c7n quy \'ae\'denh cao h\'acn ho\'c6c th\'cap h\'acn 50% (nh\'adng kh\'abng qu\'b8 70% so v\'edi thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i), sau khi th\'e8ng nh\'cat \'fd ki\'d5n v\'edi B\'e9 Th\'ad\'acng m
\'b9i, B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh quy \'ae\'denh cho t\'f5ng tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'f4 th\'d3 \'ae\'b6m b\'b6o ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch v\'b5 quan h\'d6 th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i trong t\'f5ng th\'eai k\'fa nh\'cat \'ae\'denh. 
\par c) Thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'ae\'c6c bi\'d6t \'ae\'ad\'eec \'b8p d\'f4ng cho h\'b5ng ho\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'e3 xu\'cat x\'f8 t\'f5 n\'ad\'edc ho\'c6c kh\'e8i n\'ad\'edc m\'b5 Vi\'d6t Nam v\'b5 n\'ad\'edc ho\'c6c kh\'e8i n\'ad\'edc \'ae\'e3 \'ae
\'b7 c\'e3 tho\'b6 thu\'cbn \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'ae\'c6c bi\'d6t v\'d2 thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u theo th\'d3 ch\'d5 khu v\'f9c th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i t\'f9 do, li\'aan minh quan thu\'d5 ho\'c6c \'ae\'d3 t\'b9o thu\'cbn l\'eei cho giao l\'adu th\'ad\'acng m\'b9
i bi\'aan gi\'edi.
\par Thu\'d5 su\'cat \'adu \'ae\'b7i \'ae\'c6c bi\'d6t \'ae\'ad\'eec \'b8p d\'f4ng \'ae\'e8i v\'edi h\'b5ng ho\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'e3 \'ae\'f1 c\'b8c \'aei\'d2u ki\'d6n sau \'ae\'a9y:
\par - Ph\'b6i l\'b5 nh\'f7ng m\'c6t h\'b5ng \'ae\'ad\'eec quy \'ae\'denh c\'f4 th\'d3 trong tho\'b6 thu\'cbn v\'b5 ph\'b6i \'ae\'b8p \'f8ng \'ae\'f1 c\'b8c \'aei\'d2u ki\'d6n \'ae\'b7 ghi trong tho\'b6 thu\'cbn.
\par - Ph\'b6i l\'b5 h\'b5ng c\'e3 xu\'cat x\'f8 t\'b9i n\'ad\'edc c\'e3 chung \'ae\'ad\'eang bi\'aan gi\'edi ho\'c6c t\'b9i n\'ad\'edc thu\'e9c kh\'e8i n\'ad\'edc m\'b5 Vi\'d6t Nam tham gia v\'d2 thu\'d5 theo tho\'b6 thu\'cbn.
\par B\'e9 Th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n c\'f4 th\'d3 v\'d2 ti\'aau chu\'c8n xu\'cat x\'f8 h\'b5ng ho\'b8 quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'aei\'d3m a, b, c m\'f4c 1 c\'f1a \'a7i\'d2u n\'b5y.
\par 2. Thu\'d5 su\'cat b\'e6 sung quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'aei\'d3m a, b, c kho\'b6n 2 \'a7i\'d2u 9 Lu\'cbt Thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'e6 sung t\'b9i kho\'b6n 1 \'a7i\'d2u 1 Lu\'cbt s\'e8 04/1998/QH10 ng\'b5y 20/5/1998 s
\'cf c\'e3 quy \'ae\'denh ri\'aang.
\par 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\fs26\expnd4\expndtw24 \'a7i\'d2u 2.}{ H\'b5ng xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u \'ae\'ad\'eec x\'d0t mi\'d4n thu\'d5 quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i kho\'b6n 2, \'a7i\'d2u 1 Lu\'cbt S\'f6a \'ae\'e6
i, b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a Lu\'cbt Thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u s\'e8 04/1998/QH10 \'ae\'ad\'eec quy \'ae\'denh chi ti\'d5t nh\'ad sau:
\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {1. H\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u chuy\'aan d\'efng ph\'f4c v\'f4 tr\'f9c ti\'d5p cho an ninh, qu\'e8c ph\'dfng, nghi\'aan c\'f8u khoa h\'e4c, gi\'b8o d\'f4c v\'b5 \'ae\'b5o t\'b9o \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4
n thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u theo danh m\'f4c h\'b5ng ho\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u do B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh th\'e8ng nh\'cat v\'edi c\'b8c B\'e9, ng\'b5nh c\'e3 li\'aan quan quy \'ae\'denh.
\par 2. H\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'f1a doanh nghi\'d6p c\'e3 v\'e8n \'ae\'c7u t\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i v\'b5 c\'f1a b\'aan n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i h\'eep t\'b8c kinh doanh theo Lu\'cbt \'a7\'c7u t\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t Nam \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4
n thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u theo c\'b8c quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh 12/CP ng\'b5y 18 th\'b8ng 2 n\'a8m 1996 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 quy \'ae\'denh chi ti\'d5t thi h\'b5nh Lu\'cbt \'a7\'c7u t\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t Nam, Ngh\'de 
\'ae\'denh s\'e8 10/1998/N\'a7-CP ng\'b5y 23 th\'b8ng 01 n\'a8m 1998 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 v\'d2 m\'e9t s\'e8 bi\'d6n ph\'b8p khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch v\'b5 b\'b6o \'ae\'b6m \'ae\'c7u t\'ad tr\'f9c ti\'d5p n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t Nam v\'b5 Ngh\'de 
\'ae\'denh s\'e8 62/1998/N\'a7-CP ng\'b5y 15 th\'b8ng 8 n\'a8m 1998 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 ban h\'b5nh quy ch\'d5 \'ae\'c7u t\'ad theo H\'eep \'ae\'e5ng x\'a9y d\'f9ng - kinh doanh - chuy\'d3n giao, H\'eep \'ae\'e5ng x\'a9y d\'f9ng - chuy\'d3
n giao - kinh doanh, H\'eep \'ae\'e5ng x\'a9y d\'f9ng - chuy\'d3n giao \'b8p d\'f4ng cho \'ae\'c7u t\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t Nam.
\par 3. H\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'f1a c\'b8c doanh nghi\'d6p \'ae\'c7u t\'ad trong n\'ad\'edc theo Lu\'cbt Khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch \'ae\'c7u t\'ad trong n\'ad\'edc \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4n thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u theo \'a7i\'d2u 25 Lu\'cbt Khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch \'ae\'c7
u t\'ad trong n\'ad\'edc (s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i) ng\'b5y 20 th\'b8ng 5 n\'a8m 1998.
\par 4. H\'b5ng l\'b5 qu\'b5 bi\'d5u, qu\'b5 t\'c6ng c\'f1a c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c, c\'b8 nh\'a9n n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i cho t\'e6 ch\'f8c, c\'b8 nh\'a9n c\'f1a Vi\'d6t Nam v\'b5 ng\'ad\'eec l\'b9i, h\'b5ng m\'c9u \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4n thu\'d5 theo m\'f8c quy \'ae
\'denh c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh.
\par B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh quy \'ae\'denh th\'f1 t\'f4c x\'d0t mi\'d4n thu\'d5 c\'f4 th\'d3 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi t\'f5ng tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'a7i\'d2u n\'b5y.
\par 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\fs26\expnd4\expndtw24 \'a7i\'d2u 3.}{ K\'aa khai n\'e9p thu\'d5
\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {1. T\'e6 ch\'f8c, c\'b8 nh\'a9n m\'e7i l\'c7n c\'e3 h\'b5ng ho\'b8 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p xu\'cat kh\'c8u ph\'b6i k\'aa khai, n\'e9p t\'ea khai h\'b5ng xu\'cat kh\'c8u, n\'e9p thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8
u cho c\'ac quan H\'b6i quan n\'aci l\'b5m th\'f1 t\'f4c xu\'cat kh\'c8u v\'b5 ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 t\'ddnh ch\'ddnh x\'b8c c\'f1a vi\'d6c k\'aa khai.
\par 2. T\'e6 ch\'f8c, c\'b8 nh\'a9n m\'e7i l\'c7n c\'e3 h\'b5ng ho\'b8 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p nh\'cbp kh\'c8u ph\'b6i k\'aa khai, n\'e9p t\'ea khai h\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, n\'e9p thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u cho c\'ac quan H\'b6i quan n\'aci l\'b5m th\'f1 t\'f4
c nh\'cbp kh\'c8u v\'b5 ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m v\'d2 t\'ddnh ch\'ddnh x\'b8c c\'f1a vi\'d6c k\'aa khai.
\par \'a7\'e8i v\'edi m\'e9t s\'e8 c\'f6a kh\'c8u c\'e3 l\'ad\'eeng h\'b5ng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u l\'edn; \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p m\'eb th\'aam m\'e9t s\'e8 \'ae\'dea \'aei\'d3m l\'b5m th\'f1 t\'f4c nh\'cbp kh\'c8u h\'b5ng ho\'b8 v\'b5 thu thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u. T
\'e6ng c\'f4c H\'b6i quan th\'e8ng nh\'cat \'fd ki\'d5n v\'edi B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh tr\'d7nh Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh \'ae\'dea \'aei\'d3m l\'b5m th\'f1 t\'f4c nh\'cbp kh\'c8u \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p m\'eb th\'aam.
\par C\'ac quan H\'b6i quan c\'e3 tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m ki\'d3m tra h\'b5ng ho\'b8 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, l\'b5m th\'f1 t\'f4c h\'b6i quan v\'b5 thu thu\'d5 theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh n\'b5y.
\par 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\fs26\expnd4\expndtw24 \'a7i\'d2u 4.}{ Ki\'d3m ho\'b8, t\'ddnh thu\'d5 v\'b5 th\'eai h\'b9n n\'e9p thu\'d5:
\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {1. Th\'eai \'aei\'d3m t\'ddnh thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u l\'b5 ng\'b5y m\'b5 t\'e6 ch\'f8c, c\'b8 nh\'a9n \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd t\'ea khai h\'b5ng xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8
u v\'edi c\'ac quan H\'b6i quan. Thu\'d5 \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'ddnh theo thu\'d5 su\'cat v\'b5 gi\'b8 t\'ddnh thu\'d5 t\'b9i ng\'b5y \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd t\'ea khai h\'b5ng xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u.
\par 2. Trong th\'eai h\'b9n t\'b8m (8) gi\'ea l\'b5m vi\'d6c, k\'d3 t\'f5 khi ti\'d5p nh\'cbn T\'ea khai h\'b5ng ho\'b8 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u c\'ac quan H\'b6i quan ph\'b6i th\'abng b\'b8o ch\'ddnh th\'f8c cho \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng n\'e9p thu\'d5 s
\'e8 thu\'d5 ph\'b6i n\'e9p.
\par - \'a7\'e8i v\'edi m\'e9t s\'e8 m\'c6t h\'b5ng c\'e3 s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng nh\'cbp kh\'c8u m\'e7i l\'c7n l\'edn (nh\'ad s\'bet, th\'d0p, ph\'abi th\'d0p, xi m\'a8ng, clinke, x\'a8ng d\'c7u, ph\'a9n b\'e3n ) v\'b5 nh\'f7ng m\'c6t h\'b5ng b\'bet bu\'e9c ph\'b6
i c\'e3 gi\'b8m \'ae\'denh ti\'aau chu\'c8n ch\'cat l\'ad\'eeng theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 tr\'ad\'edc khi \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p l\'adu th\'abng tr\'aan th\'de tr\'ad\'eang Vi\'d6t Nam, th\'d7 th\'eai h\'b9n th\'abng b\'b8o thu\'d5 \'ae
\'ad\'eec k\'d0o d\'b5i nh\'adng kh\'abng qu\'b8 3 ng\'b5y l\'b5m vi\'d6c do T\'e6ng c\'f4c H\'b6i quan quy \'ae\'denh c\'f4 th\'d3.
